umt-ByNuwB-SqgJZxeO7iSjGM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRS6bwrA6pyNwB0HT1WZAc1weBYlbQIrH-rswceTa--AA&oe=6B01EDD1"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_018_0000.png", "id": "3888313721408067", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499327047_3888313724741400_8433662412092859559_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-PRKXl-BslAQ7kNvwEZehKB&_nc_oc=AdpjwfqnhsoC_DIBx1sKkp68T2ae0wHDDTX-cP7IFJ_yfd8R4uWuRARCtWfNXPNfNGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSHeK2_RvF0VyQtHCprXxHOZdosn0Mx4uzLWiDweopUsw&oe=6B01C686"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SMSCP Skilldrive Training Sim", "keywords": ["engineering", "education", "mechatronics", "simulations", "training"], "long_description": "SMSCP Skilldrive is a VR-based educational training platform developed by the Virtual Mechatronics Lab to simulate key modules of the Siemens Mechatronic Systems Certification Program (SMSCP).\n\nThis experience introduces users to mechatronic systems through:\n\nSensors Scene: Learn about different types of sensors by virtually connecting and testing them in real-time.\n\nGears Scene: Explore various gear types, their operation, and real-world applications.\n\nEach module includes:\n\nEducational panels with step-by-step instructions\n\nSummarized theory content on the topic\n\nAn interactive quiz/test to assess learning outcomes\n\nDesigned to support skill development in TVET and engineering institutions, SMSCP Skilldrive enhances hands-on learning through immersive simulation aligned with global mechatronics training standards.", "short_description": "An immersive VR training platform that introduces users to Siemens SMSCP concepts through interactive sensor and gear simulations."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vml.dkut.ac.ke/docs/censent%20vr.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publish